    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make the Nile Run Red</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Armoury for the Ages.</strong> Rend your enemies with sharpened khopesh or swarm them with deadly locust plagues using your ancient and arcane arsenal.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egypt is your playground. </strong>Crawl across village rooftops and scour gargantuan pyramids in an adventure spanning the length of the Nile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tomb Rager.</strong> Plunder mysterious temples and tombs, navigating through traps and tunnels, and beating back the cult of Anubis.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beasts, barbarians and belligerent Gods. </strong>Go up against enemies from both sides of the Duat!\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DOSMan!</strong> Find the titular time-and-space traveling mascot in every level, hoarding goodies for you to gorge on.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The latest and most ambitious release from bite-sized boomer shooter studio, DOSMan Games, Skarab combines frenetic combat with exploration and platforming to deliver an adventure inspired by the likes of Powerslave, Tomb Raider and Quake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make the Nile Run Red</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Armoury for the Ages.</strong> Rend your enemies with sharpened khopesh or swarm them with deadly locust plagues using your ancient and arcane arsenal.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egypt is your playground. </strong>Crawl across village rooftops and scour gargantuan pyramids in an adventure spanning the length of the Nile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tomb Rager.</strong> Plunder mysterious temples and tombs, navigating through traps and tunnels, and beating back the cult of Anubis.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beasts, barbarians and belligerent Gods. </strong>Go up against enemies from both sides of the Duat!\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DOSMan!</strong> Find the titular time-and-space traveling mascot in every level, hoarding goodies for you to gorge on.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The latest and most ambitious release from bite-sized boomer shooter studio, DOSMan Games, Skarab combines frenetic combat with exploration and platforming to deliver an adventure inspired by the likes of Powerslave, Tomb Raider and Quake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
